Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/foreign_text_type.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     val message: Text = "hello";
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0013]: the text type is called `String`, not `Text`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_text_type.jet:2:18
    |
  2 |     val message: Text = "hello";
    |                  ^^^^
 Why: `String` is the one and only text type
 Fix: replace `Text` with `String`
